tarting from the right:.\n\nOnes place: 5 + 0 = 5.\n\nTens: 6 + 0 =6.\n\nHundreds:8 +2=10, write 0, carryover 1.\n\nThousands:6 +6 =12, plus 1 is 13, write 3, carryover 1.\n\nTen thousands: 3 +8 =11 +1=12, write 2, carryover 1.\n\nHundred thousands:8 +6=14 +1=15, write 5, carryover1.\n\nMillions:7 +6=13 +1=14, write4, carryover1.\n\nTen millions:3 +9=12 +1=13, write3, carryover1.\n\nHundred millions:6 +7=13 +1=14, write4, carryover1.\n\nBillions place: the carried over 1. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
