lace:** \\(4 + 7 = 11\\) (write 1, carry over 1 to the billions place)\n\nCombining all the results and including the carried over 1 to the billions place, we get:\n\n\\[\n1,186,550,156\n\\]\n\nThus, the sum of 440,751,465 and 745,798,691 is \\(\\boxed{1186550156}\\).",
