ers by their place values:**\n   ```\n    649,360,478\n  + 922,516,150\n  -------------\n   ```\n\n2. **Add each column from right to left, carrying over when necessary:**\n   - **Ones place:** \\(8 + 0 = 8\\)\n   - **Tens place:** \\(7 + 5 = 12\\) (write 2, carry over 1)\n   - **Hundreds place:** \\(4 + 1 + 1 = 6\\)\n   - **Thousands place:** \\(0 + 6 = 6\\)\n   - **Ten thousands place:** \\(6 + 1 = 7\\)\n   - **Hundred thousands place:** \\(3 + 5 = 8\\)\n   - **Millions place:** \\(9 + 2 = 11\\) (write 1, carry over 1)\n   - **Ten millions place:** \\(4 + 2 + 1 = 7\\)\n   - **Hundred millions place:** \\(6 + 9 = 15\\) (write 5, carry over 1)\n   - **Billions place:** The carried over 1\n\n3. **Combine all the results:**\n   - Billions place: 1\n   - Hundred millions place: 5\n   - Ten millions place: 7\n   - Millions place: 1\n   - Hundred thousands place: 8\n   - Ten thousands place: 7\n   - Thousands place: 6\n   - Hundreds place: 6\n   - Tens place: 2\n   - Ones place: 8\n\nPutting it all together, the sum is \\(1,571,876,628\\).\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1571876628}\n\\]",
