n millions place:** \\(3 + 3 + 1 = 7\\)\n9. **Hundred millions place:** \\(3 + 3 = 6\\)\n\nPutting it all together, we get the result 699,562,075. Verifying by breaking into parts:\n\n- Millions: \\(363,000,000 + 336,000,000 = 699,000,000\\)\n- Remaining parts: \\(171,983 + 390,092 = 562,075\\)\n- Total: \\(699,000,000 + 562,075 = 699,562,075\\)\n\nThus, the sum of 363171983 and 336390092 is \\(\\boxed{699562075}\\).",
