\n\nPosition2:3 (tens).\n\nPosition3:5 (hundreds).\n\nPosition4:4 (thousands).\n\nPosition5:8 (ten thousands).\n\nPosition6:6 (hundred thousands).\n\nPosition7:5 (millions).\n\nPosition8:3 (ten millions).\n\nPosition9:7 (hundred millions).\n\nSo arranging them from highest to lowest place value:.\n\nHundred millions:7.\n\nTen millions:3.\n\nMillions:5.\n\nHundred thousands:6.\n\nTen thousands:8.\n\nThousands:4.\n\nHundreds:5.\n\nTens:3.\n\nOnes:9. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
