gether from position 10 down to 1:.\n\nPosition 10: 1.\n\nPosition 9: 6.\n\nPosition 8: 4.\n\nPosition 7: 5.\n\nPosition 6: 6.\n\nPosition 5: 2.\n\nPosition 4: 8.\n\nPosition 3: 6.\n\nPosition 2: 0.\n\nPosition 1: 8. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
