ace:** 6 + 9 + 1 (carry) = 16 \u2192 Write 6, carry over 1.\n   - **Billions place:** Carry over 1.\n\n3. **Combine all results:**\n   \n   The final sum is **1,648,528,629**.\n\n**Answer:** The sum is \\boxed{1648528629}.",
