\(6 + 7 = 13\\) (write 3, carry over 1)\n   - Millions place: \\(5 + 4 + 1 = 10\\) (write 0, carry over 1)\n   - Ten millions place: \\(4 + 3 + 1 = 8\\)\n   - Hundred millions place: \\(3 + 7 = 10\\) (write 0, carry over 1)\n   - Billions place: The carried over 1.\n\n3. Combining all the results from each place value, we get the number:\n   \\[\n   1,080,377,724\n   \\]\n\nThus, the sum of 345,631,564 and 734,746,160 is \\(\\boxed{1080377724}\\).",
